        "lang": "en",
        "note_tweet": {
          "text": "Interesting: OpenAI explored buying Goodfire, the Anthropic-backed startup that looks inside AI models to understand why they behave the way they do, for more than $5 billion, The Information reports. \n\nYou probably remember the uproar in September, when reports said GPT-6 Astra does part of its reasoning in hidden loops to be more efficient, leaving less readable chain of thought to monitor. \n\nGoodfire's approach skips the chain of thought and looks at the math running inside the model directly."
        },
